  "prompt": "The paid media team tracks budget pacing: the share of the budget planned so far that has been spent so far. Take each paid channel and month in budget_monthly from July 2025 to October 2025 (month holds the first day of the month). A channel's spend in a month is the total spend of the ad_spend_daily rows of its campaigns whose spend_date, a UTC day, falls in that month; a month with no spend counts as 0. The running totals start in July 2025 and add each channel's months in order of month. Return six columns, in this order: channel_name; month; spend_eur, the channel's spend in that month; spend_to_date_eur, the channel's spend from July 2025 up to and including that month; budget_to_date_eur, the channel's budget_eur from July 2025 up to and including that month; and pacing_pct, 100 times spend_to_date_eur divided by budget_to_date_eur, rounded to 1 decimal, or missing when budget_to_date_eur is 0. Return one row for each channel and month in budget_monthly in that period. Sort by channel_name from A to Z, then by month from earliest to latest.",
